# HTTPS in front of the API (ADR-16). Caddy gets and renews the Let's Encrypt certificate for
# API_DOMAIN (ports 80 and 443 must be open) and forwards everything to the API, whose context
# path is /api. No access log: query strings may hold personal data (backend/CLAUDE.md).
{$API_DOMAIN} {
	encode zstd gzip
	reverse_proxy api:8080
}
